OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,6,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,7,Fsunshine and a few isolated showers
OL,8,Ffollow from the northwest during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with these outbreaks
OL,10,Ffocused over the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers isolated initially,
OL,13,Fbuilding overnight and turning wintry
OL,14,Fat times at low levels. Clear spells
OL,15,Fand light winds, bringing a frosty
OL,16,Fstart to week for many.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FFrosty start for many. Sunny
OL,19,Fspells. Most dry but showers in far
OL,20,Fnorth during the morning. Higher cloud
OL,21,Ffeeding from south for afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
